iscover many Hanfu styles and experience the process of making a piece of Hanfu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671070/extras/b3026443f84bb4167c84c8434aa1c32b.poster.avif?t=1770020896\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671070/extras/b3026443f84bb4167c84c8434aa1c32b.webm?t=1770020896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671070/extras/b3026443f84bb4167c84c8434aa1c32b.mp4?t=1770020896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★ A taste of romance: Players can pursue male or female characters in the game. Once affection reaches a certain level, the hand-holding mode can be unlocked, allowing you to date, dine, and play with your favorite character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671070/extras/bbd9cb72806aa3f3bab052e2782e5f4d.poster.avif?t=1770020896\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671070/extras/bbd9cb72806aa3f3bab052e2782e5f4d.webm?t=1770020896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671070/extras/bbd9cb72806aa3f3bab052e2782e5f4d.mp4?t=1770020896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★ Learn about Hanfu styles: In this game, players will discover many Hanfu styles and experience the process of making a piece of Hanfu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671070/extras/cba61e5df8daeb3a94810fb439ce1d89.poster.avif?t=1770020896\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671070/extras/cba61e5df8daeb3a94810fb439ce1d89.webm?t=1770020896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671070/extras/cba61e5df8daeb3a94810fb439ce1d89.mp4?t=1770020896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★ Simple entrepreneurship: Say goodbye to complicated business simulation games. This game allows you to experience the sense of achievement in opening a Hanfu store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671070/extras/b7090427b3f91879ca46dbaaef6b6f85.poster.avif?t=1770020896\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671070/extras/b7090427b3f91879ca46dbaaef6b6f85.webm?t=1770020896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671070/extras/b7090427b3f91879ca46dbaaef6b6f85.mp4?t=1770020896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★ Escape room scenarios: In real life, escape rooms might have many taboos, but in this game, you can explore boldly without spending too much money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671070/extras/1965ba3a88df8cb614ac8e6ddb10df38.poster.avif?t=1770020896\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671070/extras/1965ba3a88df8cb614ac8e6ddb10df38.webm?t=1770020896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic